  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of Danida Support to Value Chain Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the evaluation is to contribute to improving the design and implementation of Danida&apos;s bilateral programme cooperation under inclusive green growth and employment by documenting results and experience and providing recommendations for future support to value chain development. This will be achieved by assessing Danida support to value chain development and systematising lessons learned.</narrative>
